# Leaf crown (#421): the decor kind `crown`, native 96x40, one frame, hung from the room top (its top edge on the
# room's top edge). It tops a `Decor:trunk` standing under its middle (trunk object x = crown x + 40): the middle lobe
# hangs to the last row and hides the trunk's rounded cap. Leaf clusters with lighter tops and darker undersides.
# Decor tier (D76): the bush's muted grey-green family, one step lighter than the bush (by day over 4a92b8: outline 0.087
# against the bush palette's 0.157); night palette (D92): every colour mixed 35 % toward 2c3f66 (contour 607660 -> 4e6362),
# outline 0.111, body 0.180 over the night, ceiling 0.20; contour in its own darker green, no ink 0b0814,
# no violet (violet is the FallingBranch's bud accent). Not solid, never moves.
# Layered-forest recolour (#236, D112): OKLab L x0.55, hue kept, over the new layers outline 0.036 to 0.184, body 0.144 to 0.190.
size 96 40
color k 162929
color d 1b2e29
color m 1f322b
color l 23362d
color n 2d3022
frame crown
